1. Identity Crisis: Erik Erikson formulated the concept of adolescent identity crisis within his 8-stage psychosocial theory (A -> II);
2. Collective unconscious: Carl Jung proposed that humans share an inherited reservoir of memories and archetypes (B -> III);
3. Classical Conditioning: Ivan Pavlov discovered conditioned salivary reflexes in dogs (C -> IV);
4. Observational Learning: Albert Bandura demonstrated learning through social modeling and vicarious reinforcement (D -> I).
This matches: (A)-(II), (B)-(III), (C)-(IV), (D)-(I).
Hence, option (C) is the correct match.

